[00:00.50]We thank you, Jehovah, each day and each night,
[00:11.19]That you shed upon us your precious light.
[00:21.28]We thank you that we have the priv’lege of prayer,
[00:32.86]That we can approach you with ev’ry care.
[00:42.36]We thank you, Jehovah, for your loving Son,
[01:26.74]Who conquered the world; by his faith he won.
[01:30.01]We thank you for guidance in doing your will.
[01:33.37]You lovingly help us our vows fulfill.
[01:36.27]We thank you, our God, for the honor to preach
[01:39.54]About your great name and the truth to teach.
[01:42.90]We thank you that soon all earth’s woes will be past,
[01:48.92]While your Kingdom blessings forever last.
